1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:29,150
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,210
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,080
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,390
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,190
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,860
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,910
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:02,710
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 7=

12
00:01:19,950 --> 00:01:20,590
Song Ziyuan,

13
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,430
there's a hidden passage here.

14
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:50,790
Song Ziyuan,

15
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:51,640
over there.

16
00:02:15,710 --> 00:02:16,520
This clay figure

17
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,560
is different from the others.

18
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,430
Look.

19
00:02:21,190 --> 00:02:22,520
Someone tampered with it here.

20
00:02:37,150 --> 00:02:38,120
It's just like that bamboo slip

21
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:39,800
we found under the tree that day.

22
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,190
The same bloodstains.

23
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,960
The same aura.

24
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:47,280
So, in this city,

25
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:48,800
someone's deliberately doing harm.

26
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,310
Wait, no!

27
00:02:52,750 --> 00:02:53,470
Don't kill me!

28
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:54,630
Who are you?

29
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,190
Why are you here?

30
00:02:57,470 --> 00:02:59,120
Did Zhong Jiang capture you?

31
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:00,360
(Fusheng)
My...

32
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,190
My name is Luo Fusheng.

33
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,710
I'm from Yan City.

34
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,800
I've studied carving since I was young.

35
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,059
I heard Mr. Zhong Jiang of Jinan City

36
00:03:08,101 --> 00:03:09,000
was highly skilled,

37
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,870
so I came to apprentice under him.

38
00:03:11,590 --> 00:03:12,400
But then

39
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:14,000
he locked me up here.

40
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,800
He locked you up here.

41
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:17,960
Did he do anything else?

42
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,630
He... He said...

43
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:22,430
He said he'd use me for soul molding
or something.

44
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,360
I don't know either.

45
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:26,120
Where is he?

46
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:27,080
He...

47
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,840
He's dead.

48
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:30,630
Dead?

49
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,729
He only locked me up here.

50
00:03:32,771 --> 00:03:34,000
He didn't deserve to die, did he?

51
00:03:34,310 --> 00:03:35,400
What kind of people are you?

52
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:36,680
You...

53
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,240
You're not going to kill me too,
are you?

54
00:03:38,750 --> 00:03:40,120
Why would we kill you?

55
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,910
You can leave now.

56
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,280
Let's go too.

57
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,800
My saviors,

58
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:51,960
please help me a little more.

59
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,910
I...

60
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:55,190
I'm truly starving.

61
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:00,660
(Song Residence)

62
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,560
Are you a savage?

63
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,190
The way you eat is disgusting!

64
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,040
It's mainly because
I haven't eaten in so long.

65
00:04:18,390 --> 00:04:19,240
I was starving.

66
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:20,480
Also,

67
00:04:20,750 --> 00:04:22,510
the food you prepared is delicious.

68
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:27,800
Slow down.

69
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,430
Go home after you're done.

70
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:41,950
There's a snake! Snake!

71
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,870
Just eat.

72
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:44,870
It won't bite you.

73
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,270
Fine, I got it.

74
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,510
You're talking to a snake?

75
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,720
None of your business.

76
00:05:02,190 --> 00:05:02,950
Finish it all.

77
00:05:03,510 --> 00:05:04,190
Don't waste it.

78
00:05:17,870 --> 00:05:20,160
I know I was a bit rough yesterday.

79
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:22,000
But I had no choice.

80
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,390
Just give me two more days.

81
00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:25,950
Just two more days, okay?

82
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:27,190
- Hey, stop.
- You little liar.

83
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,249
- Stop scolding.
- Stop trying to pluck me bald.

84
00:05:28,291 --> 00:05:29,190
I don't even have leaves left.

85
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:30,579
You're awfully rude

86
00:05:30,621 --> 00:05:31,830
for someone so old.

87
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:34,390
You...

88
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:35,800
How could you hit me?

89
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,830
Just hold on one more day for me.

90
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:39,720
Just one day.

91
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,680
I'll go steal the Myriad Souls Lamp.

92
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,950
What are you doing here?

93
00:05:45,870 --> 00:05:47,390
Are you talking to a tree?

94
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:48,830
Yes.

95
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:50,270
Aren't you scared?

96
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:51,560
Chu Li...

97
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:52,720
Why haven't you left yet?

98
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,950
Can you teach me?

99
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,830
I'm willing to take you as my master.

100
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,600
What are you doing? Get up, now.

101
00:06:00,870 --> 00:06:01,560
Chu Li,

102
00:06:02,310 --> 00:06:03,630
please accept me as your apprentice.

103
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:05,040
I'll be your beast of burden,

104
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,120
following you through fire and water.

105
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,480
That won't do.

106
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:08,510
Chu Li,

107
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,680
just take me as your apprentice.

108
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,609
Please, just take me.

109
00:06:10,651 --> 00:06:11,659
- Don't be like this.
- Please?

110
00:06:11,701 --> 00:06:12,720
It's not appropriate.

111
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:23,830
What do you think you're doing?

112
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,630
Buddy,

113
00:06:25,830 --> 00:06:26,800
I'm trying to become her apprentice.

114
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,070
Buddy?

115
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:31,070
This is Diviner Song of Chu State.

116
00:06:31,430 --> 00:06:32,390
Diviner Song?

117
00:06:34,190 --> 00:06:35,430
Forgive me. I didn't know who you were!

118
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:37,920
Why haven't you left yet?

119
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,430
I...

120
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,360
I have nowhere else to go.

121
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,070
My family...

122
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:47,560
they're all dead.

123
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,160
I came to Jinan City

124
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,270
just to make a living.

125
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,510
But I never thought I'd get tricked.

126
00:06:57,070 --> 00:06:57,920
Diviner Song,

127
00:06:59,190 --> 00:06:59,920
Chu Li,

128
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,600
please take me in.

129
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,750
There are plenty of people
trying to make a living.

130
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:07,950
If everyone came to Diviner Song
to be taken in,

131
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,040
there'd be no room left

132
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,830
for anyone to stand.

133
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,560
You're able-bodied,

134
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,830
and you're not that young anymore.

135
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:16,120
Even by begging on the streets,
you won't starve.

136
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:18,160
Figure something out yourself.

137
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,310
I'll have someone give you some money.

138
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:23,870
From now on,

139
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:25,390
you'll have to fend for yourself.

140
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,430
Diviner Song.

141
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,000
I never expected you to be so kind,
Diviner Song.

142
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,070
And I didn't expect

143
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:52,160
you to be so perceptive, Miss Chu Li.

144
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,830
People respect the Shaman Clan,

145
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:56,560
yet fear and shun us

146
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,950
for who we are.

147
00:07:59,070 --> 00:08:00,630
Since I was young,

148
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,830
I've seen as much coldness as you have.

149
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,870
Miss Chu Li, you understand
the human heart so well.

150
00:08:06,190 --> 00:08:08,160
You truly are the best candidate
for Grand Shaman.

151
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,560
You've reminded me of something.

152
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,120
I'm afraid

153
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,680
we can't wait any longer.

154
00:08:15,070 --> 00:08:15,830
Why?

155
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,040
Didn't I tell you?

156
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:20,139
I found some friends
who've cultivated for years

157
00:08:20,181 --> 00:08:21,310
and borrowed a wisp of spirit essence

158
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:23,070
to sustain your body.

159
00:08:23,830 --> 00:08:24,729
But what happened yesterday

160
00:08:24,771 --> 00:08:26,360
took too great a toll
on their primordial spirits.

161
00:08:26,870 --> 00:08:27,680
They said...

162
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,150
It can last at most one more day.

163
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:33,480
Then

164
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:34,600
after one day,

165
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:36,670
our souls will swap again?

166
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,670
Yes.

167
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,480
If we can't find the Myriad Souls Lamp,

168
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:44,489
I'm afraid we'll have to live forever

169
00:08:44,531 --> 00:08:45,720
in each other's bodies.

170
00:08:48,630 --> 00:08:49,600
But didn't you say

171
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,510
the Myriad Souls Lamp is
your Shaman Clan's sacred relic,

172
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,270
only usable by the Grand Shaman?

173
00:08:53,870 --> 00:08:54,720
That's right.

174
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,200
So I plan to...

175
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,120
Steal it.

176
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:17,120
This is your plan?

177
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:19,790
The Myriad Souls Lamp
is kept in the ritual hall.

178
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,750
Yun Hua placed a ward on the hall.

179
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,360
If I take the lamp,

180
00:09:23,630 --> 00:09:24,630
it'll alert her.

181
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:29,480
But you can't make me seduce her.

182
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:30,870
What's wrong with a little sacrifice?

183
00:09:31,270 --> 00:09:32,440
I'm doing this for you.

184
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,480
If you made me Grand Shaman right now,

185
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,670
you could drop dead

186
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,750
for all I care.

187
00:09:39,150 --> 00:09:39,960
Get up.

188
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,720
Go.

189
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:44,550
Who's there?

190
00:09:48,150 --> 00:09:49,150
Diviner Song?

191
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:51,720
Why are you here at this hour?

192
00:09:53,720 --> 00:09:54,600
Miss Yun Hua,

193
00:09:54,870 --> 00:09:56,320
there's something about Chu Li

194
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,720
I'd like to discuss with you.

195
00:09:58,270 --> 00:09:59,150
Chu Li?

196
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:01,790
Let's

197
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:03,630
talk somewhere private.

198
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:25,550
Honored ancestors,

199
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,320
please forgive me.

200
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:36,720
Diviner Song,

201
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,960
Chu Li has been unruly since childhood.

202
00:10:40,750 --> 00:10:41,510
Now

203
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:43,480
you've finally seen her true colors,
right?

204
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,150
Yes.

205
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,670
Diviner Song, do you know

206
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:50,030
where Chu Li is now?

207
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:52,200
She hasn't come back for days.

208
00:10:52,510 --> 00:10:55,270
I don't know if she's causing trouble
out there again.

209
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,030
About that...

210
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:58,870
I'm not quite sure.

211
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:03,240
Well, Diviner Song,
since you have nothing else to discuss,

212
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,840
I'll get back to my duties.

213
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,270
Miss Yun Hua.

214
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:11,750
I actually

215
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,630
greatly admire how you handle
all Shaman Clan affairs

216
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,670
with such dedication.

217
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:20,510
Do you truly think so, Diviner Song?

218
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,030
Of course.

219
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:23,790
I've noticed it all.

220
00:11:25,550 --> 00:11:27,080
With the Grand Shaman in seclusion,

221
00:11:27,600 --> 00:11:29,550
I believe the next Grand Shaman

222
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:30,910
must be you.

223
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,030
You flatter me, Diviner Song.

224
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,240
I'd like to

225
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:37,670
chat with you in detail.

226
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:48,510
This trick works.

227
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:56,240
Diviner Song?

228
00:11:57,390 --> 00:11:58,390
Why are you back?

229
00:11:58,550 --> 00:11:59,240
Where's Yun Hua?

230
00:12:02,510 --> 00:12:04,080
What are you doing? What's wrong?

231
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:07,720
What are you doing?

232
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:20,750
Getting into trouble is one thing,

233
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:23,840
but now you dare steal
Shaman Clan's sacred relic?

234
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:34,840
(Diviner Song,)

235
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:37,510
(I don't know what you and Chu Li
are plotting,)

236
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:39,670
(but did you think a few words)

237
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:41,390
(would make me trust you?)

238
00:12:44,790 --> 00:12:46,670
Diviner Song, I know

239
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,870
you must have been bewitched by Chu Li.

240
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,750
Rest assured.

241
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,510
Once I kill her,

242
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,600
I'll set you free.

243
00:13:14,870 --> 00:13:15,550
I'm sorry.

244
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:23,270
I'm sorry.

245
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:46,200
Chu Li,

246
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:47,320
quick, think of something.

247
00:13:47,630 --> 00:13:49,270
I'm thinking!

248
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:52,000
Consorting with demons all day long...

249
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:53,960
What makes you think you're worthy
of being in the Shaman Clan?

250
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,720
You use puppets to control people.

251
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,120
You're no better.

252
00:13:57,270 --> 00:13:57,840
You...

253
00:14:05,670 --> 00:14:06,670
Xiuxiu, bite her!

254
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,480
Did she die from the bite?

255
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,320
No, she's not dead.

256
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:38,870
Xiuxiu's venom

257
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:40,360
only puts people into deep sleep.

258
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,630
She'll wake up tomorrow morning.

259
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,550
She'll wake up tomorrow morning?

260
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:46,960
Then what about the lamp?

261
00:14:48,720 --> 00:14:49,600
We'll stay here

262
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,840
and repair your soul.

263
00:14:52,630 --> 00:14:53,510
Once it's repaired,

264
00:14:53,750 --> 00:14:54,790
we'll put the lamp back.

265
00:14:57,030 --> 00:14:58,200
At worst, she'll scold us.

266
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:58,649
It's fine.

267
00:14:58,691 --> 00:14:59,960
You Shaman Clan people

268
00:15:00,270 --> 00:15:01,320
are truly terrifying.

269
00:15:07,550 --> 00:15:08,320
Something's wrong.

270
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:09,390
What is it?

271
00:15:10,870 --> 00:15:11,480
This...

272
00:15:12,030 --> 00:15:13,720
This lamp has no wick?

273
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:15,440
It's a useless lamp.

274
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:24,630
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

275
00:15:26,250 --> 00:15:31,710
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

276
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:36,560
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

277
00:15:36,730 --> 00:15:40,040
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

278
00:15:40,170 --> 00:15:45,950
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

279
00:15:47,410 --> 00:15:52,630
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

280
00:15:54,490 --> 00:16:00,680
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

281
00:16:00,930 --> 00:16:04,440
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

282
00:16:04,490 --> 00:16:07,779
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

283
00:16:07,821 --> 00:16:14,760
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

284
00:16:15,010 --> 00:16:18,320
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

285
00:16:18,650 --> 00:16:22,560
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

286
00:16:22,610 --> 00:16:28,920
♪When all turns to mist,
